Implemented per-app channel chips on dashboard panels from existing Once state:

- `internal/docker/channels.go` — derives `running`, `stopped`, `deploying`, `stale`, `unhealthy`, `no-backup`, `idle` (30 days).
- `internal/ui/channels.go` + `dashboard_panel.go` — renders colored `[chip]` labels, trimming trailing chips on narrow panels.
- `internal/ui/dashboard.go` — loads backup state once and refreshes it every minute.

Verified: `make test` passes, `make lint` passes with `0 issues`.
